    ],
    "after_listing": "If allotted (retail allotment can be a lottery, so you may get nothing): on listing day place a sell order for half at your target, and sell everything if it lists below the issue price of Rs 136.00. Target for the first half: inside the Rs 129.20 to Rs 146.88 range, ideally near the top. Keep the rest only with a stop at the issue price and move it up as the price rises. Risk is limited to the one lot.",
